{
  "slug": "revelata",
  "name": "Revelata",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Equity research and fundamental analysis skills powered by Revelata deepKPI.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `benchmark` (Operational peer / comp discovery for US public companies via deepKPI semantic search — not valuation multiples), `company-summary` (Answer \"what does this company do?\" and segment / geography questions using deepKPI: get_company_summary (narrative summary) and get_company_segments…), `filing` (Retrieves SEC filing markdown from Revelata deepKPI for US public companies: full filing text in chat (10-K/10-Q/8-K as…), `ideas` (Idea-generation onramp for users who don't know what to look at yet), `implied-metric` (Computes a financial or operational metric that isn't directly reported, using the algebraic relationship between available quantities), `kpi` (Retrieves financial and operational KPIs for a US public company from Revelata's deepKPI database), `pressure-test` (Pressure-test any analyst report on a US public company), `revelata` (Broad orchestrator for Revelata deepKPI research on US public companies — use for complex multi-step queries that cross…), and 1 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `revelata`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install revelata@claude-community` from `revelata/deepkpi-agents`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
